-- Dungeon plans for the run leader (.bot run), exported by turtle-agent (plan-export). Plan format v1; the mapping is
-- docs/guides/dungeon-run-leader.md ("From plan v1 to rows"). The plan file in turtle-agent is the single source: edit it
-- there and export again, never these rows by hand. The plan row carries the unit lists cc_priority, cc_always and kill_first
-- (columns from 20261015200000_world.sql). Never edit this file once applied; export a new one.
--
-- Idempotent: each plan's rows are deleted, then inserted. The tables come from 20261014150000_world.sql.

-- turtle-agent 6ab6e4c (plan/dr35-fixes): `plan-export --allow-draft --gm-cross-direct --floor-aware --approach-hops
-- --mmaps <the server's mmaps> --rev 6ab6e4c --stamp 20261105130000`. Round 35 route fixes: maraudon_purple (a pull 20 yd
-- below the anchor gets its approach down the ledge), razorfen_kraul (the last approach row stands within the run leader's
-- reach of the boss), razorfen_downs (the opening move of leg 0 is cut from the plan's entrance), shadowfang_keep (team
-- horde: its courtyard gossip is Deathstalker Adamant 3849, hostile to the Alliance). scarlet_graveyard is re-exported with
-- the same cutter; its round-35 stop is a run leader finding (the lead bot on a navmesh sliver), not a row.

-- maraudon_purple: map 349, 6 legs, 1273 steps
DELETE FROM `ai_dungeon_step` WHERE `plan` = 'maraudon_purple';
DELETE FROM `ai_dungeon_leg` WHERE `plan` = 'maraudon_purple';
DELETE FROM `ai_dungeon_plan` WHERE `plan` = 'maraudon_purple';

